        "quote": "No, nothing else. You've made it worse."
      }
    ],
    "status": "unresolved",
    "confidence": 1.0,
    "rationale": "The cancellation was not processed because the customer refused the fee, and the agent could not waive it, leaving the customer unsatisfied and terminating the call."
  },
